; Models: two bars of a chip lead melody in D minor | Neglects: an echo channel | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: loop
1.4*(@voice-chip(t, f0=D5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.125b, f0=F5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.25b, f0=A5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.375b, f0=D6, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.5b, f0=C6, len=0.1875b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.6875b, f0=A5, len=0.0625b) + @voice-chip(t - 0.75b, f0=Bb5, len=0.25b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.0b, f0=A5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.125b, f0=G5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.25b, f0=F5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.375b, f0=E5, len=0.125b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.5b, f0=F5, len=0.1875b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.6875b, f0=E5, len=0.0625b) + @voice-chip(t - 1.75b, f0=D5, len=0.25b))
